                        



Item #:  SCP-5951

Object Class:  Safe

Special Containment Procedures: 

SCP-5951 is to be kept in a standard secure locker in Site-77.

Personnel with Level 2 or higher security clearance are authorized to use SCP-5951 for recreational purposes after filling out the appropriate paperwork.

Description: 

SCP-5951 is a packet of Carnation Breakfast Essential Breakfast Mix with a seemingly infinite amount of powder inside it. In all prior testing, SCP-5951 has shown no difference from Non-Anomalous Carnation Breakfast Essential Powder. Hence, SCP-5951 has since been deemed as safe to be used for recreational purposes.

                    

                                    





            
    

                    



                    
                        
                            
